Subject: SDL: serialize window visibility with Vulkan presentation

Hiding an SDL Wayland surface while QueuePresentKHR is active can leave Mesa
waiting forever for a frame callback. Hold one lock across show/hide and the
presentation path, and skip rendering while the surface is hidden. This also
allows an application to hide and reopen its windows within one session.

--- a/src/Backends/SDLBackend.cpp
+++ b/src/Backends/SDLBackend.cpp
